 begin="1:09.367" end="1:14.356" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.367" end="1:09.778">而</span><span begin="1:09.778" end="1:10.379">走在</span><span begin="1:10.379" end="1:11.039">角落</span><span begin="1:11.039" end="1:11.652">的人</span><span begin="1:11.652" end="1:12.340">却只</span><span begin="1:12.340" end="1:12.769">有</span><span begin="1:12.769" end="1:14.356">我</span></p><p begin="1:14.785" end="1:19.842" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.785" end="1:15.694">我只想</span><span begin="1:15.694" end="1:16.435">静静</span><span begin="1:16.435" end="1:17.140">离开</span><span begin="1:17.140" end="1:17.839">独自</span><span begin="1:17.839" end="1:18.161">徘</span><span begin="1:18.161" end="1:19.842">徊</span></p><p begin="1:20.006" end="1:24.916" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.006" end="1:20.969">在这陌</span><span begin="1:20.969" end="1:21.678">生却</span><span begin="1:21.678" end="1:22.333">最自</span><span begin="1:22.333" end="1:22.948">由的</span><span begin="1:22.948" end="1:23.337">时</span><span begin="1:23.337" end="1:24.916">刻</span></p></div><div begin="1:25.395" end="1:46.499"><p begin="1:25.395" end="1:30.458" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.395" end="1:26.385">一场雨</span><span begin="1:26.385" end="1:27.016">揉</span><span begin="1:27.016" end="1:27.762">进乡</span><span begin="1:27.762" end="1:28.357">间的</span><span begin="1:28.357" end="1:28.832">朦</span><span begin="1:28.832" end="1:30.458">胧</span></p><p begin="1:30.668" end="1:35.769" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.668" end="1:31.687">在湖边</span><span begin="1:31.687" end="1:33.068">回忆往昔</span><span begin="1:33.068" end="1:33.677">的每</span><span begin="1:33.677" end="1:34.056">分</span><span begin="1:34.056" end="1:35.769">钟</span></p><p begin="1:36.124" end="1:41.209" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.124" end="1:36.437">你</span><span begin="1:36.437" end="1:37.586">是否在</span><span begin="1:37.759" end="1:38.428">仰望</s